  "_comment": "Cross-language KAT bridge for params_hash. Each entry is a (circuit, params) pair and the expected SHA-256 over their canonical encoding. Both the Rust prover and the TS CLI compute params_hash from the same canonical bytes and must agree to the byte. Regenerate with: TRUSSET_KAT_REFRESH=1 cargo test -p trusset-prover --test params_hash_kat",
